Q: Background image too large, not responding to size:cover; etc A: <p>Thanks to C3roe:</p>
<pre><code>&lt;html&gt;
&lt;body&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;container&quot;&gt;
&lt;object-fit src=&quot;korenmolendehoop.jpeg&quot;&gt;

&lt;!-- more types of divs etc !--&gt;

&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/body&gt;
&lt;/html&gt;
</code></pre>
<p>works perfectly</p>

Q: MIDI Output in Unity A: <p>You can take a look at how it's implemented in <a href="https://github.com/melanchall/drywetmidi" rel="nofollow noreferrer">DryWetMIDI</a>, for example: <a href="https://github.com/melanchall/drywetmidi/blob/develop/DryWetMidi/Multimedia/OutputDevice/OutputDevice.cs" rel="nofollow noreferrer">Output device</a>.</p>
<p>Usage:</p>
<pre class="lang-cs prettyprint-override"><code>using Melanchall.DryWetMidi.Multimedia;
using Melanchall.DryWetMidi.Core;

// ...

private IOutputDevice _outputDevice;

// ...

_outputDevice = OutputDevice.GetByName(&quot;Output device&quot;); // or GetByIndex(1)
_outputDevice.SendEvent(new NoteOnEvent());

// ...

_outputDevice.Dispose();
</code></pre>
